40
00:11:38.760 --> 00:11:41.560 align:center size:90%
Just when I moved, after living in Barcelona for 12
years.

41
00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:45.820 align:center size:90%
Now I’m moving again next week, to Brussels.

42
00:11:47.180 --> 00:11:48.420 align:center size:90%
And I’m performing it here again.

43
00:11:52.550 --> 00:11:55.610 align:center size:90%
Now it’s no longer a presentation; it’s a
representation.

44
00:11:56.130 --> 00:11:59.290 align:center size:90%
Because I’m constantly working with something I’ve
already worked on.

45
00:11:59.510 --> 00:12:02.150 align:center size:90%
Everything you’ve been seeing for the past two, four
years.

46
00:12:03.510 --> 00:12:06.450 align:center size:90%
I’m no longer the person you’re seeing in my scene.

47
00:12:07.530 --> 00:12:10.450 align:center size:90%
So, throughout this month of revisiting the piece,

48
00:12:13.880 --> 00:12:17.720 align:center size:90%
There’s something very beautiful about this body
that still interests me a lot,

49
00:12:19.440 --> 00:12:22.720 align:center size:90%
but I see myself more in representation than in
presentation.

50
00:12:23.620 --> 00:12:24.620 align:center size:90%
So,

51
00:12:27.340 --> 00:12:28.340 align:center size:90%
